# The image builds from source: nothing generated or local crosses into the context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-types
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Never in the image: harness files, documents, local data, the web bundle (Pages).
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
WORKLOG.md
.claude
docs
data
tiles
tiles-dem
tmp
loadtest
web/e2e
web/budgets
web/public
